<title>USA: Armco CFO David Harmer to Resign Dec. 31.</title>
<headline>Armco CFO David Harmer to Resign Dec. 31.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armco Inc said its Chief Financial Officer David Harmer will resign December 31 to become president of FMC Corp's Jetway Systems unit.</p>
<p>Armco said it has not yet named a successor to Harmer, who is 53.</p>
<p>In joining FMC, Harmer returns to the company he left in 1993 and relocates to his home state of Utah, Armco said.</p>
</text>
